        "interests",
        "productivity",
        "something_else"
      ],
      "type": "string"
    },
    "current_state": {
      "description": "The one-line user-facing state. For goal metadata of every type, write one short pulse from the newest evidence that states the single most useful current or forward-looking status: a result, progress marker, specific wait, blocker, monitored condition, or scheduled event. Do not claim work is currently in progress, append a generic next step, or restate the title or description. For add_entry or edit_entry, state the activity's main outcome.",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "description": {
      "description": "For create or update, write two or three natural, user-facing sentences that explain the goal at a high level. Put detailed progress and state changes in entries instead. For add_entry or edit_entry, write one concise, human-friendly sentence about what happened and, when applicable, what the result was.",
      "type": "string"
    },
